{
  "title": "Home and household",
  "note": "Hay means there is and there are and never changes: Hay una mesa, Hay dos sillas. Use estar for where people and things are: estoy, estás, está, estamos, estáis, están. La cama está en el dormitorio. In Spain an apartment is often el piso; in Latin America, el departamento or el apartamento.",
